WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,500
What's going on in your head?

2
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:10,530
What are you thinking about, Director?

3
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:14,010
You can clearly see them on the surveillance camera continuing to hurt people.

4
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,330
Stop telling me these things

5
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,740
You think I don’t know about the one named Dalong?

6
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,180
I'm very close to you guys

7
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:34,700
Come back to me immediately, Uncle Chen

8
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:40,390
I've heard it before. Are you okay? I'm okay. It's Uncle Chen.

9
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,030
Am I too high-profile?

10
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:45,070
I feel like I can cause trouble and high profile wherever I go.

11
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,110
You are a female star with a lot of money.

12
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:49,150
Still driving a luxury car into a car and making headlines?

13
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,670
You can't even make a contribution to the world

14
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:51,990
Everything is connected

15
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:56,030
You used to be just one of these sentient beings and you don’t understand what you are now

16
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:57,670
The weight in this world is different

17
00:00:58,070 --> 00:00:59,390
Like lotus clothes in the pond

18
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:01,750
You are no longer that little lion, I guess you understand

19
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:03,070
It turns out that I am a naked horse

20
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:04,550
At most, it's just a chicken fighting a dog.

21
00:01:05,150 --> 00:01:06,710
Now he is just like the grandson monkey of heaven

22
00:01:07,110 --> 00:01:08,070
The one who ate it secretly was Pan Tao

23
00:01:08,270 --> 00:01:13,060
What you secretly drank was jade wine. It’s okay to say that. You’re right. Don’t reflect blindly.

24
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:14,540
Sometimes it's not you who did something wrong

25
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:17,100
It’s the people who make you reflect who have their own problems
